div(class="space-y-8")
    div(*ngIf="loading", class="flex min-h-[18rem] items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50")
        div(class="text-center")
            div(class="mx-auto h-7 w-7 animate-spin rounded-full border-2 border-slate-300 border-t-orange-500")
            p(class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500") IdP 정보를 불러오는 중...

    div(*ngIf="!loading && idpInfo", class="space-y-7")
        header(class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-b border-slate-200 pb-6 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between")
            div
                p(class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-orange-600") IdP information
                h2(class="mt-1.5 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950") 연결 정보와 응답 설정
                p(class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600") 먼저 Metadata를 연결하고, 필요한 경우에만 이름이 있는 실행 설정을 만드세요.
            button(type="button", class="h-10 rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 transition hover:bg-slate-50", (click)="loadInfo()") 새로고침

        section(class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-orange-200 bg-white")
            header(class="border-b border-orange-100 bg-orange-50 px-5 py-4")
                div(class="flex flex-col gap-3 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between")
                    div(class="max-w-2xl")
                        div(class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2")
                            span(class="flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-orange-500 text-xs font-bold text-white") A
                            h3(class="text-base font-bold text-slate-950") 실행 설정
                            span(class="rounded-full bg-white px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-orange-700 ring-1 ring-orange-200") 선택 기능
                        p(class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600") 이름을 붙여 저장하는 테스트 설정입니다. 저장한 이름이 포함된 SAML endpoint에만 적용되며, 일반 SSO 확인에는 만들 필요가 없습니다.
                    span(*ngIf="profileResult", class="inline-flex rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold", [class]="profileResult.standards_status === 'standard' ? 'bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800' : 'bg-amber-100 text-amber-800'") {{profileResult.standards_status === 'standard' ? '표준 설정' : '호환 시험 설정'}}

            div(class="space-y-7 p-6")
                div(class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4")
                    div(class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3")
                        div
                            h4(class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900") 저장된 실행 설정
                            p(class="mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500") 선택하면 저장된 값과 해당 SAML Metadata·endpoint를 바로 불러옵니다.
                        button(type="button", class="rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-50", (click)="startNewProfile()") 새 설정
                    p(*ngIf="profileOptions.length === 0", class="mt-3 rounded-lg border border-dashed border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm text-slate-500") 아직 저장된 실행 설정이 없습니다.
                    div(*ngIf="profileOptions.length > 0", class="mt-3 grid max-h-48 gap-2 overflow-auto pr-1 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3")
                        button(*ngFor="let item of profileOptions", type="button", class="rounded-xl border px-3 py-3 text-left transition", [class]="profileOptionClass(item.name)", (click)="selectProfile(item)")
                            span(class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2")
                                strong(class="truncate text-sm font-semibold") {{item.name}}
                                span(class="shrink-0 rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold", [class]="item.standards_status === 'standard' ? 'bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700' : 'bg-amber-100 text-amber-800'") {{item.standards_status === 'standard' ? '표준' : '호환 시험'}}
                            span(class="mt-1 block text-xs opacity-70") {{item.sign_response ? 'Response 서명' : 'Response 미서명'}} · {{item.response_variant}}

                div(class="grid gap-3 lg:grid-cols-[1.25rem_minmax(0,1fr)_auto] lg:items-end")
                    span(class="hidden h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-[11px] font-bold text-white lg:flex") 1
                    div
                        label(class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900") 설정 이름
                        input([(ngModel)]="profileName", (ngModelChange)="profileChanged()", placeholder="예: keycloud-saml-a", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-slate-900 focus:border-orange-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-orange-100")
                        p(class="mt-1.5 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500") 영문 소문자, 숫자, 하이픈만 사용할 수 있습니다. 이 이름이 들어간 Metadata와 SSO/SLO endpoint가 함께 만들어집니다.
                    button(type="button", [disabled]="profileBusy", class="h-10 rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 transition hover:bg-slate-50 disabled:opacity-50", (click)="loadProfile()") {{profileBusy ? '처리 중...' : '불러오기'}}

                div
                    div(class="flex items-center gap-2")
                        span(class="flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-[11px] font-bold text-white") 2
                        h4(class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900") 확인할 상황 선택
                    div(class="mt-3 grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4")
                        button(type="button", [class]="presetClass('standard')", (click)="applyPreset('standard')")
                            strong(class="block text-sm font-semibold") 기본 SSO
                            span(class="mt-1 block text-xs leading-5 opacity-75") Response·Assertion 서명
                        button(type="button", [class]="presetClass('encrypted')", (click)="applyPreset('encrypted')")
                            strong(class="block text-sm font-semibold") Assertion 암호화
                            span(class="mt-1 block text-xs leading-5 opacity-75") AES-256-GCM·RSA-OAEP
                        button(type="button", [class]="presetClass('attributes')", (click)="applyPreset('attributes')")
                            strong(class="block text-sm font-semibold") Attribute 매핑
                            span(class="mt-1 block text-xs leading-5 opacity-75") 다중값 fixture 포함
                        button(type="button", [class]="presetClass('error')", (click)="applyPreset('error')")
                            strong(class="block text-sm font-semibold") 오류 응답
                            span(class="mt-1 block text-xs leading-5 opacity-75") 만료 Assertion부터 시작

                div
                    div(class="flex items-center gap-2")
                        span(class="flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-[11px] font-bold text-white") 3
                        h4(class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900") 주요 값 확인
                    div(class="mt-3 grid gap-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 p-4 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4")
                        label(class="flex min-h-12 items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700")
                            input(type="checkbox", [(ngModel)]="signResponse", (ngModelChange)="profileChanged()", class="h-4 w-4 rounded border-slate-300 text-orange-500 focus:ring-orange-500")
                            span Response 서명
                        label(class="flex min-h-12 items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700")
                            input(type="checkbox", [(ngModel)]="signAssertion", (ngModelChange)="profileChanged()", class="h-4 w-4 rounded border-slate-300 text-orange-500 focus:ring-orange-500")
                            span Assertion 서명
                        label(class="flex min-h-12 items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700")
                            input(type="checkbox", [(ngModel)]="encryptAssertion", (ngModelChange)="profileChanged()", class="h-4 w-4 rounded border-slate-300 text-orange-500 focus:ring-orange-500")
                            span EncryptedAssertion
                        label(class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") 응답 형태
                            select([(ngModel)]="responseVariant", (ngModelChange)="profileChanged()", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm")
                                option(value="standard") 표준 응답
                                option(value="wrong_issuer") Issuer 불일치
                                option(value="wrong_audience") Audience 불일치
                                option(value="expired") 만료됨
                                option(value="future_not_before") 미래 NotBefore
                                option(value="unsigned") 서명 없음
                                option(value="bad_ciphertext") Ciphertext 변조
                                option(value="authn_failed") AuthnFailed
                                option(value="no_authn_context") NoAuthnContext
                                option(value="request_denied") RequestDenied
                                option(value="responder") Responder

                details(class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white")
                    summary(class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800")
                        span 고급 응답 설정
                        span(class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 group-open:hidden") 펼치기
                        span(class="hidden text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 group-open:inline") 접기
                    div(class="grid gap-4 border-t border-slate-200 p-4 md:grid-cols-2")
                        label(class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") Content encryption
                            select([(ngModel)]="contentEncryptionAlgorithm", (ngModelChange)="profileChanged()", [disabled]="!encryptAssertion", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm disabled:bg-slate-100")
                                option(value="aes256-gcm") AES-256-GCM · 권장
                                option(value="aes192-gcm") AES-192-GCM
                                option(value="aes128-gcm") AES-128-GCM
                                option(value="aes256-cbc") AES-256-CBC · 호환 시험
                                option(value="aes192-cbc") AES-192-CBC · 호환 시험
                                option(value="aes128-cbc") AES-128-CBC · 호환 시험
                                option(value="tripledes-cbc") TripleDES-CBC · 호환 시험
                        label(class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") Key transport
                            select([(ngModel)]="keyTransportAlgorithm", (ngModelChange)="profileChanged()", [disabled]="!encryptAssertion", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm disabled:bg-slate-100")
                                option(value="rsa-oaep-sha256") RSA-OAEP SHA-256 · 권장
                                option(value="rsa-oaep-sha1") RSA-OAEP SHA-1 · 호환 시험
                                option(value="rsa-1_5") RSA v1.5 · 호환 시험
                        label(class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") Assertion 만료(초)
                            input(type="number", [(ngModel)]="assertionTtlSeconds", (ngModelChange)="profileChanged()", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm")
                        label(class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") 시간 이동(초)
                            input(type="number", [(ngModel)]="timeOffsetSeconds", (ngModelChange)="profileChanged()", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm")
                        label(class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") 누락할 Attribute · 한 줄에 하나
                            textarea([(ngModel)]="omitAttributesText", (ngModelChange)="profileChanged()", rows="4", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white p-3 font-mono text-xs leading-5")
                        label(class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700") Attribute 값 JSON
                            textarea([(ngModel)]="attributeValuesText", (ngModelChange)="profileChanged()", rows="4", class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white p-3 font-mono text-xs leading-5")

                div(*ngIf="profileMessage", class="rounded-xl border px-4 py-3", [class]="profileResult?.standards_status === 'compatibility' ? 'border-amber-200 bg-amber-50' : 'border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50'")
                    p(class="text-sm font-semibold", [class]="profileResult?.standards_status === 'compatibility' ? 'text-amber-900' : 'text-emerald-800'") {{profileMessage}}
                    ul(*ngIf="profileResult?.standards_warnings?.length", class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm text-amber-800")
                        li(*ngFor="let warning of profileResult.standards_warnings") {{warning}}

                footer(class="flex flex-col-reverse gap-2 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-end")
                    button(type="button", [disabled]="profileBusy || !hasSavedProfile()", class="h-10 rounded-xl border border-rose-200 bg-white px-4 text-sm font-semibold text-rose-700 transition hover:bg-rose-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40", (click)="deleteProfile()") {{profileBusy ? '처리 중...' : '실행 설정 삭제'}}
                    button(type="button", [disabled]="profileBusy", class="h-10 rounded-xl bg-orange-500 px-5 text-sm font-bold text-white transition hover:bg-orange-600 disabled:opacity-50", (click)="saveProfile()") {{profileBusy ? '처리 중...' : '저장하고 endpoint 적용'}}

        section(class="space-y-4")
            div(class="flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between")
                div
                    h3(class="text-base font-bold text-slate-950") 연결에 필요한 값
                    p(class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500") SP에는 Metadata URL을 먼저 등록하세요. 수동 등록이 필요할 때 아래 값을 사용합니다.
                span(class="rounded-full bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700") Metadata 서명됨

            div(class="grid gap-4 xl:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.4fr)_minmax(18rem,0.6fr)]")
                div(class="space-y-3")
                    div(class="rounded-xl border border-orange-200 bg-orange-50 p-4")
                        div(class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3")
                            div(class="min-w-0")
                                p(class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-orange-700") Entity ID
                                p(class="mt-2 break-all text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950") {{idpInfo.entity_id}}
                            button(type="button", class="shrink-0 rounded-lg border border-orange-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-orange-700", (click)="copyToClipboard(idpInfo.entity_id, 'entityId')") {{copied === 'entityId' ? '복사됨' : '복사'}}
                    div(class="grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-2")
                        div(class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4")
                            p(class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900") SSO endpoint
                            div(class="mt-3 space-y-3")
                                div(class="grid grid-cols-[4.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-2")
                                    span(class="rounded-md bg-orange-50 px-2 py-1 text-center text-xs font-bold text-orange-700") POST
                                    span(class="break-all text-sm text-slate-600") {{idpInfo.sso_post}}
                                div(class="grid grid-cols-[4.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-2")
                                    span(class="rounded-md bg-orange-50 px-2 py-1 text-center text-xs font-bold text-orange-700") Redirect
                                    span(class="break-all text-sm text-slate-600") {{idpInfo.sso_redirect}}
                        div(class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4")
                            p(class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900") SLO endpoint
                            div(class="mt-3 space-y-3")
                                div(class="grid grid-cols-[4.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-2")
                                    span(class="rounded-md bg-sky-50 px-2 py-1 text-center text-xs font-bold text-sky-700") POST
                                    span(class="break-all text-sm text-slate-600") {{idpInfo.slo_post}}
                                div(class="grid grid-cols-[4.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-2")
                                    span(class="rounded-md bg-sky-50 px-2 py-1 text-center text-xs font-bold text-sky-700") Redirect
                                    span(class="break-all text-sm text-slate-600") {{idpInfo.slo_redirect}}
                aside(class="space-y-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4")
                    div
                        p(class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900") 지원 정보
                        p(class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600") {{idpInfo.sign_algorithm}}
                    div(class="flex flex-wrap gap-2")
                        span(*ngFor="let fmt of idpInfo.nameid_formats", class="rounded-full bg-white px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-slate-600 ring-1 ring-slate-200") {{getNameIdShort(fmt)}}
                    details(class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white")
                        summary(class="cursor-pointer px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700") Signing Certificate
                        div(class="border-t border-slate-200 p-3")
                            pre(class="max-h-40 overflow-auto whitespace-pre-wrap break-all font-mono text-[11px] leading-5 text-slate-600") {{idpInfo.certificate}}
                            button(type="button", class="mt-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600", (click)="copyToClipboard(idpInfo.certificate, 'cert')") {{copied === 'cert' ? '복사됨' : '인증서 복사'}}

        section(class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white")
            header(class="flex flex-col gap-3 border-b border-slate-200 px-5 py-4 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between")
                div
                    h3(class="text-base font-bold text-slate-950") IdP Metadata XML
                    p(class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500") 표준 응답이 기본입니다. 호환 시험은 선택 즉시 상태가 구분됩니다.
                div(class="flex flex-wrap gap-2")
                    select([(ngModel)]="metadataVariant", (ngModelChange)="reloadMetadataVariant()", class="h-9 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 text-sm text-slate-700")
                        option(value="standard") 표준 · 서명됨
                        option(value="unsigned") 호환 시험 · 서명 없음
                        option(value="bad_signature") 호환 시험 · 잘못된 signature
                    button(type="button", class="h-9 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700", (click)="copyToClipboard(metadataXml, 'xml')") {{copied === 'xml' ? '복사됨' : 'XML 복사'}}
                    button(type="button", class="h-9 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 px-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white", (click)="downloadXml()") 다운로드
            pre(class="max-h-[30rem] overflow-auto bg-slate-950 p-5 font-mono text-xs leading-6 text-slate-200") {{metadataXml}}

    div(*ngIf="!loading && !idpInfo", class="rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-slate-300 bg-slate-50 p-10 text-center")
        p(class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700") IdP 정보를 불러오지 못했습니다.
        button(type="button", class="mt-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white", (click)="loadInfo()") 다시 시도
